Source: save.inc
     1 				; .XCS saver. Three passes over the same generator (genpay):
     2 				;   wrm=2 counts the pool (strings, bytes), cells, rows and the payload length
     3 				;   wrm=0 computes the CRC-16 and the plain checksum
     4 				;   wrm=1 writes the header, the payload and the CRC to the file
     5 				; Pool order: custom formats, sheet name, then every string a cell references (no de-duplication).
     6 				; Only sheet 1 is written; names and charts are not kept (the loader skips them).
     7
