     1 				; Cell entry and editing: a printable key starts entry (mode 1), Return stores, Esc cancels.
     2 				; ^E edits the cell, Backspace clears it, ^F cycles the number format (0-7), ^B toggles bold.
     3 				; Text starting with = is a formula (stored without the =), a complete AFP number is a number, anything else is text.
     4
